DESCRIPTION:Pace: Level is posted per ride. The Ciudad Universitaria ride
 s (30 km\, flat\, by the Insurgentes bike lane) are marked beginner to i
 ntermediate; the Ajusco and gravel rides are intermediate to advanced.\n
 Schedule: Saturdays\, meet 7:00 am\, roll 7:10 am\, from the Ciclópolis
  Coyoacán shop. The route changes each week: Ajusco on Oct 3\, a themed
  city ride to the Monumento a la Revolución on Oct 10\, Ciudad Universi
 taria on Oct 17\, a gravel ride with Gravel Mafia on Oct 24\, a Hallowee
 n ride to Ciudad Universitaria on Oct 31.\nConfirm with the host before 
 you go.\nhttps://cycleforchange.org/rides/mexico-city-mx-ciclopolis-satu
 rday-rodada/
